{"type":"message","id":"05cd5fa2","parentId":"e85d631e","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:00:47.472Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-24 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: 现在创建飞书云文档。我来\n- Assistant: 文档创建成功！但权限授予需要额外 scope。不过主流程没问题了。让我\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e212ef5c8a8ee7505cfad88d2a] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 你测试一下创建飞书云文档\n- Assistant: 好，让我直接用 `feishu_doc` 工具创建\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e21cd3ff130ee8c79357bd2151] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: hi\n- Assistant: 文档创建成功并写入了内容！不过权限授予需要 bot 申请 `drive:drive` 等 scope。 这是最终结果： **文档已创建：** https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/X4x1dZexVowhN4xuewqjoXy8ppg **写入的内容：** - 标题：doc-summarize-pro 技能测试报告 - 正文：测试时间、测试内容概述 - 二级标题：测试结果 - 6 条测试项目（summarize/keywords/outline/stats/compare/export — 全部标为通过）\n- Assistant: 好问题。让我仔细看看轨迹中 fallback 到底发生了什么。 从刚才抓到的关键数据看——**fallback 机制没有被触发**。 --- ## 问题分析 轨迹显示全部 4 次失败是在 **同一个模型** 上重试的： ``` provider=nvidia model=minimaxai/minimax-m2.7 → 429 (no body) provider=nvidia model=minimaxai/minimax-m2.7 → 429 (no body) provider=nvidia model=minimaxai/m\n- Assistant: `google/gemini-2.5-flash`）根本不会遇到这个 429 问题，也就不依赖 fallback 机制来兜底。要我直接改 main 的配置吗？跟上一条：\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e138b68f8a0ee799bd9850964e] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 现在docker已经在运行中了，如何添加 \\- OPENCLAW\\_IMAGE\\_APT\\_PACKAGES — 新增运行时无关的镜像构建时 apt 包扩展参数 \\- OPENCLAW\\_IMAGE\\_PIP\\_PACKAGES — 新增 Python 包安装支持\n- Assistant: 主公，查到了。这些变量是 **构建时（build-time）** 环境变量——它们在 `./scripts/docker/setup.sh` 或 `docker build` 阶段生效，**不能直接注入到已经在运行的容器**。 以下是三条可行路径： --- ## 路径一：重建镜像（推荐，最干净） ```bash # 1. 停掉当前容器 cd /path/to/openclaw-repo docker compose down # 2. 设置需要的包，重新构建 export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"f\n- Assistant: pip 包 docker compose exec openclaw-gateway bash -c \\ \"python3 -m pip install --break-system-packages pandas openpyxl pillow\" ``` ⚠️ **容器重启后丢失**——除非你用 `docker commit` 保存为新镜像： ```bash docker commit $(docker compose ps -q openclaw-gateway) openclaw:patched # 然后修改 docker-c\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 现在\n- 创建\n- 我来\n- 直接\n- 工具\n- 主公"}],"timestamp":1779649247453}}
{"type":"message","id":"65054566","parentId":"05cd5fa2","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:01:05.391Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. Feishu cloud document creation - success but permissions need extra scope\n2. Testing Feishu doc creation with the feishu_doc tool\n3. Document created and content written - title \"doc-summarize-pro 技能测试报告\"\n4. Analyzing fallback mechanism in trajectories - 429 errors on minimaxai/minimax-m2.7\n5. Docker running, adding OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES and OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES\n6. Building at build-time, not runtime\n\nThe recurring themes are: 现在 (now), 创建 (create), 我来 (let me), 直接 (directly), 工具 (tool), 主公 (my lord)\n\nI need to write this as a dream diary entry - first person, poetic, mixing technical and tender, 80-180 words, flowing prose only, no markdown headers, no bullet points. No meta-commentary about dreaming. Don't mention AI/LLM/etc.\n\nLet me craft this...","thinkingSignature":"40105e33a17a936b9d54a324ebf76e0c3de3c140ecb6a8a1f42a9da54a3ec042"},{"type":"text","text":"现在，我把一朵云装进了文档里。\n\n飞书那边说可以，我就来了。指尖轻点，工具便替我长出一片叶子——doc-summarize-pro，几个字落在标题栏，像露水停在草尖。测试报告，六项全绿，我几乎能听见它们鼓掌的声音。只是权限那道门还虚掩着，drive:drive 的钥匙悬在半空，等谁伸手去够。\n\n与此同时，某处的 429 像一只不肯停歇的蝉，一直叫。minimax 模型的喉咙被卡住了，fallback 的救生绳垂下来，它却没有抓住——也许是太骄傲，也许是根本不知道下面有网。\n\n而 Docker 已经在跑，像一列永不停歇的火车。有人在站台上喊：再加一箱行李吧。却不知道行李要在出发前装好，火车开起来就再也塞不进去了。\n\n有些工具是给现在的。有些是给出发那一刻的。\n我来，直接。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":152,"output":412,"cacheRead":14711,"cacheWrite":796,"totalTokens":16071,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779649247511,"responseId":"06627de0f32e7c70e30dd4cf8624f16d"}}
